# Plan for Issue #1803: CI: daily super run failed

## Summary of the Failure in Super Run 40092032153

Daily super run 40092032153 on `main` at commit `1d6ec71` reported four failing/cancelled jobs:
1. `fuzz (2/4)`: Failed in the handicapped wave at seed 3278 due to panic `the board did not settle in 100 passes` inside `crates/engine/src/state_check.rs` (`state_check`).
2. `fuzz (1/4)`: Failed in the handicapped wave at seed 1557 due to `[checkpoint] checkpoint took 6590ms, past CHECKPOINT_TIME_BOUND_MS (5000ms)` inside `crates/tools/src/fuzz.rs` (`check_serial_restart`).
3. `fuzz (4/4)`: Cancelled due to `fail-fast: true` after shards 1 and 2 failed.
4. `e2e (4/8)`: Shard 4 specs failed on Chrome in the super run. The regression fixes for multiple activates ([#1770](https://github.com/Jlore-Studios/JackiOh/pull/1770), commit `d7fa6dccd`) and AI candidate priority ([#1801](https://github.com/Jlore-Studios/JackiOh/pull/1801), commit `36ac34b4c`) are already merged onto `main` and present on this branch `bot/issue-1803`.

